        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Raita serves 4 and takes about 15 minutes. Squeeze the grated cucumber to remove water so the raita is not runny. Toast the cumin seeds first for the best aroma."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Toast and crush the cumin seeds to bring out their warm, nutty flavour."
          }
        ]
