      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Raita is the cool note on a spiced plate. It calms the heat of a hot curry. Cucumber and mint keep it fresh. Serve it with biryani, curry or rice. It takes minutes and lifts the whole meal."
          }
        ]
      }
